<title>USA: Brooks Fiber unit gets clearance in R.I..</title>
<headline>Brooks Fiber unit gets clearance in R.I..</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brooks Fiber Properties Inc said Friday a unit of the company has been granted authority to provide local exchange telecommunications services in Rhode Island.</p>
<p>Brooks Fiber Communications of Rhode Island Inc, a wholly owned subsidiary of Brooks Fiber, was granted the authority by the Rhode Island Public Utilities Commission, the company said.</p>
<p>This authority allows Brooks Fiber to expand its local offerings to include the full range of telecommunications services, it said.</p>
<p>	    -- Reuter Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
